        "text_9EEnDz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NADCO® warrants its products to be free from defects in material and workmanship at the time of shipment. Should any product fail to conform to this warranty, and upon verification that the product has been properly stored, handled, and applied in accordance with NADCO recommendations, NADCO will, at its discretion, replace the defective product or issue a credit not exceeding the original purchase price.</p><p>Product suitability for a specific application is the responsibility of the purchaser. Technical data, specifications, and application recommendations are based on testing believed to be reliable but do not constitute a guarantee of performance in all environments.</p><p>This warranty is exclusive and in lieu of all other warranties, express or implied, including warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose.</p><p>In no event shall NADCO be liable for incidental, indirect, or consequential damages, including but not limited to loss of profit, production downtime, or loss of capital. NADCO’s total liability arising from the sale, delivery, or use of its products shall not exceed the purchase price of the product giving rise to the claim.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-inherit",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
